{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/react/14_react_router_dom/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>/detail 로 접속하면 상세페이지를,<br>\n/cart 로 접속하면 장바구니 페이지를 보여주자.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-react에서-페이지를-나누는-방법\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. React에서 페이지를 나누는 방법<a href=\"#1-react%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80%EB%A5%BC-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"1 react에서 페이지를 나누는 방법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li>컴포넌트를 만들어서 상세페이지 내용을 만든다.</li>\n<li>/detail 로 접속하면 그 컴포넌트를 보여준다.</li>\n<li>React-router-dom 라이브러리로 쉽게 구현할 수 있다.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"2-react-router-dom-설치\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. React-router-dom 설치<a href=\"#2-react-router-dom-%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98\" aria-label=\"2 react router dom 설치 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://v5.reactrouter.com/web/guides/quick-start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://v5.reactrouter.com/web/guides/quick-start</a><br>\n해당 사이트에서 제공하는 문서를 보고 설치하자.<br>\n<del>찾기가 어렵다</del></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> react-router-dom\r\n<span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> react-router-dom@6</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"3-셋팅하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">3. 셋팅하기<a href=\"#3-%EC%85%8B%ED%8C%85%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"3 셋팅하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>src/index.js 파일로 가서 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;BrowserRouter></code> 로 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;App /></code>을 감싸면 된다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// src/index.js</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> BrowserRouter <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react-router-dom\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> root <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ReactDOM<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">createRoot</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getElementById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'root'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\nroot<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">render</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>React<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>StrictMode<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>BrowserRouter<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>App <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>BrowserRouter<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>React<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>StrictMode<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"4-react-router-dom-사용법\" style=\"position:relative;\">4. react-router-dom 사용법<a href=\"#4-react-router-dom-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"4 react router dom 사용법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"4-1-라우터로-페이지-나누는-법\" style=\"position:relative;\">4-1. 라우터로 페이지 나누는 법<a href=\"#4-1-%EB%9D%BC%EC%9A%B0%ED%84%B0%EB%A1%9C-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EB%8A%94-%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"4 1 라우터로 페이지 나누는 법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>상단에 여러가지 컴포넌트를 import 한다.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;Routes></code> 만들고 그 안에 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;Route></code>를 작성한다.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;Route path=\"/경로\" element={&lt;Component />} /></code> 작성</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// App.js</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> Routes<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Route<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Link <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-router-dom'</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">App</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>생략<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Routes<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Route path<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/\"</span> element<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>메인페이지임<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Route path<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/detail\"</span> element<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>상세페이지임<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Route path<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/about\"</span> element<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>어바웃페이지임<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>Routes<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"4-2-페이지-이동-link\" style=\"position:relative;\">4-2. 페이지 이동, Link<a href=\"#4-2-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80-%EC%9D%B4%EB%8F%99-link\" aria-label=\"4 2 페이지 이동 link permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>상단에 Link 컴포넌트를 import한다.<br>\n원하는곳에 Link를 쓴다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Link to<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>홈<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>Link<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Link to<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/detail\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>상세페이지<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>Link<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"4-3-페이지-이동-usenavigate\" style=\"position:relative;\">4-3. 페이지 이동, useNavigate()<a href=\"#4-3-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80-%EC%9D%B4%EB%8F%99-usenavigate\" aria-label=\"4 3 페이지 이동 usenavigate permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>useNavigate()를 쓰면 그 자리에 유용한 함수가 남는다. 페이지를 이동시켜주는 함수다.<br>\nnavigate(“/detail”) : /detail 페이지로 이동<br>\nnavigate(-1) : 뒤로 1번<br>\nnavigate(2) : 앞으로 2번</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// App.js</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> useNavigate <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-router-dom'</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">App</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> navigate <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">useNavigate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>생략<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token function\">navigate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'/detail'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>이동버튼<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"4-4-404-페이지-설정\" style=\"position:relative;\">4-4. 404 페이지 설정<a href=\"#4-4-404-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80-%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95\" aria-label=\"4 4 404 페이지 설정 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>없는 경로로 접속했을 때 404 페이지 보여주는 방법은<br>\nRoute path에 * (모든경로)를 넣어준다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Route path<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"*\"</span> element<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token number\">404</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"4-5-서브경로를-만들-수-있는-nested-routes--outlet\" style=\"position:relative;\">4-5. 서브경로를 만들 수 있는 Nested routes / Outlet<a href=\"#4-5-%EC%84%9C%EB%B8%8C%EA%B2%BD%EB%A1%9C%EB%A5%BC-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4-%EC%88%98-%EC%9E%88%EB%8A%94-nested-routes--outlet\" aria-label=\"4 5 서브경로를 만들 수 있는 nested routes  outlet permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>/about/member 로 접속하면 회사 멤버 소개하는 페이지<br>\n/about/locaion 으로 접속하면 회사 위치 소개하는 페이지를 띄우는 법</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Route path<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/about/member\"</span> element<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>멤버들<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Route path<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/about/location\"</span> element<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>회사위치<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>이렇게 만들어도 되지만</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Route path<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/about\"</span> element<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>About<span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">></span>  \r\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Route path<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"member\"</span> element<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Members <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Route path<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"location\"</span> element<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Location <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>Route<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>이렇게 만들어도 된다.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;Route></code> 안에 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;Route></code>를 넣을 수 있는데 이것을 Nested routes 라고 한다.</p>\n<p>이렇게 사용하면<br>\n/about/member 로 접속 시 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;About /></code>과 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;Members /></code>을 보여준다.<br>\n/about/location 으로 접속 시 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;About /></code>과 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;Location /></code>를 보여준다.</p>\n<p><strong>About Component 안에 element 들은 Outlet 컴포넌트 안에 보여진다.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">About</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h4<span class=\"token operator\">></span>about<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h4<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Outlet <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\t<span class=\"token comment\">// 이 자리에 Members or Location이 표시된다.</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#1-react%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80%EB%A5%BC-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\">1. React에서 페이지를 나누는 방법</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#2-react-router-dom-%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98\">2. React-router-dom 설치</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#3-%EC%85%8B%ED%8C%85%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\">3. 셋팅하기</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#4-react-router-dom-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EB%B2%95\">4. react-router-dom 사용법</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#4-1-%EB%9D%BC%EC%9A%B0%ED%84%B0%EB%A1%9C-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EB%8A%94-%EB%B2%95\">4-1. 라우터로 페이지 나누는 법</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#4-2-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80-%EC%9D%B4%EB%8F%99-link\">4-2. 페이지 이동, Link</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#4-3-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80-%EC%9D%B4%EB%8F%99-usenavigate\">4-3. 페이지 이동, useNavigate()</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#4-4-404-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80-%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95\">4-4. 404 페이지 설정</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#4-5-%EC%84%9C%EB%B8%8C%EA%B2%BD%EB%A1%9C%EB%A5%BC-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4-%EC%88%98-%EC%9E%88%EB%8A%94-nested-routes--outlet\">4-5. 서브경로를 만들 수 있는 Nested routes / Outlet</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Sep 30, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"14. react router dom","summary":"/detail 로 접속하면 상세페이지를, /cart 로 접속하면 장바구니 페이지를 보여주자. 1. React에서 페이지를 나누는 방법 1. 컴포넌트를 만들어서 상세페이지 내용을 만든다. 2. /detail 로 접속하면 그 컴포넌트를 보여준다. 3. React-router-dom 라이브러리로 쉽게 구현할 수 있다.","date":"Nov 11, 2022","categories":["REACT"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/react/14_react_router_dom/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/react/13_public_src_이미지_사용_시_경로_사용법/","title":"13. public, src 이미지 사용 시 경로, 사용법"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/react/15_react_router_dom_url_parameter/","title":"15. react-router-dom URL parameter"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}